        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "51-1. There shall be no reprisals of any kind taken by the Board, its servants, agents, or employees against any teacher or member of the JCEA by reason of membership in the JCEA or participation of its activities or by reason of his-her employment and/or his-her school-connected activities.",
