        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "51-3. The Association agrees that teachers will, if requested, meet with parents during the evening not more than twice during the school year exclusive of the traditional open-house practice. One of said three (3) meetings shall be held after school hours and the other two (2) shall be held in the evening.",
